      "source": "Groups the parsed PDF pages into <a href=\"../../document/Document.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.document\"><code>Document</code></a>s. You can group one or more pages\ninto a single output document. Use <a href=\"config/PdfDocumentReaderConfig.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.reader.pdf.config\"><code>PdfDocumentReaderConfig</code></a> for customization\noptions. The default configuration is: - pagesPerDocument = 1 - pageTopMargin = 0 -\npageBottomMargin = 0",
      "translation": "将解析后的 PDF 页面分组为 <a href=\"../../document/Document.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.document\"><code>Document</code></a>。您可以将一个或多个页面组合成一个输出文档。使用 <a href=\"config/PdfDocumentReaderConfig.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.reader.pdf.config\"><code>PdfDocumentReaderConfig</code></a> 进行自定义选项配置。默认配置如下：- pagesPerDocument = 1 - pageTopMargin = 0 - pageBottomMargin = 0",
      "count": 1
